  "label": "frustrated emotion",
  "description": "The emotion of frustration is conveyed through the overlaid text 'you took us to the wrong mountain bro,' which humorously implies that the baboons are confused or misled. The visual of the baboons in various postures—some sitting, some standing, some facing away—suggests a sense of casual observation or confusion, reinforcing the feeling of being wrongfully directed. The humor derives from the situational irony of animals being portrayed as frustrated, which is a common meme format.",
